/extras/b138881142611c0773145153f4ed9942.poster.avif?t=1680021380\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954840/extras/b138881142611c0773145153f4ed9942.webm?t=1680021380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954840/extras/b138881142611c0773145153f4ed9942.mp4?t=1680021380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>**** ATTENTION ****</strong> <br>Fractured Sanity was developed by 3 people. 2 developers and one writer. We are doing our best to fix any bugs or VR headset incompatibilities our players may find  (we tested on Quest 2, which is what we have). If you find an issue, please reach out to us on discord or any social media and we'll do our best to help you out.",
